,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/commits/88ffc36308bb63dc4d8bba4e1b1646c9b6ac507f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-19T05:47:53Z","email":"branzan.pablo@gmail.com","name":"Pablo Ferreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-19T05:47:53Z","email":"branzan.pablo@gmail.com","name":"Pablo Ferreira"},"message":"feat(layout): implement standardized container classes following industry patterns\n\n- Created utility classes in styles.scss:\n  * .container-article (max-w-4xl) - for articles and reading content\n  * .container-wide (max-w-7xl) - for grids and wide layouts\n  * .container-narrow (max-w-2xl) - for forms and focused reading\n  * .container-header (max-w-6xl) - for header and footer\n\n- Refactored all pages to use standardized classes:\n  * post-detail, about, terms, privacy, newsletter-page → container-article\n  * home hero section, posts filters → container-wide\n  * editor-demo → container-header\n\n- Refactored all layout components:\n  * header.component.ts → container-header\n  * footer.component.ts → container-header\n  * post-grid.component.ts → container-wide\n  * newsletter.component.ts → container-article/narrow based on variant\n\nBenefits:\n- Consistent width standards across entire application\n- Follows market patterns (Medium, Vercel, Stripe)\n- Single source of truth for layout widths\n- Easier maintenance and scalability\n- Better separation of concerns (layout vs content)\n- Professional design system implementation\n\nFiles changed: 13 components/pages + styles.scss","tree":{"sha":"1b9d27d9602756a600fc4b0d084ab06e32ecb4a8","url":"https://api.github.com/