821849,"login":"branzan-pablo","node_id":"U_kgDOCooWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/commits/91ea377ee4a28a8b3ce37cb1695c0fdccc19e98c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-13T00:21:52Z","email":"branzan.pablo@gmail.com","name":"Pablo Ferreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-13T00:21:52Z","email":"branzan.pablo@gmail.com","name":"Pablo Ferreira"},"message":"feat: Adicionar syntax highlighting com Prism.js\n\n🎨 Implementar Prism.js para highlighting avançado:\n\n**MarkdownService:**\n- Importação dinâmica do Prism.js com verificação SSR\n- Carregamento automático das linguagens principais (TS, JS, CSS, JSON, Bash)\n- Método público highlightAllCode() para aplicação manual\n- Detecção inteligente de blocos de código com linguagem\n\n**PostDetailComponent:**\n- Implementar AfterViewChecked para aplicar highlighting\n- Flag de controle para evitar aplicações desnecessárias\n- Reset da flag para cada novo post carregado\n\n**Estilos CSS (styles.scss):**\n- Tema escuro personalizado inspirado no GitHub Dark\n- Cores otimizadas para legibilidade e contraste\n- Estilização específica por tipo de token (keywords, strings, comments)\n- Scrollbar customizada para blocos de código\n- Indicadores visuais de linguagem\n\n**Linguagens suportadas:**\n- TypeScript/JavaScript ✅\n- CSS/SCSS ✅\n- JSON ✅\n- Bash/Shell ✅\n- Markdown ✅\n\n**Benefícios:**\n- Bundle pequeno (~3KB) com carregamento sob demanda\n- Compatível com SSR/Angular Universal\n- Performance otimizada com lazy loading\n- Experiência de leitura profissional","tree":{"sha":"4e1942afa1613ee40cd5580425c931b783e3cf47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/git/trees/4e1942afa1613ee40cd5580425c931b783e3cf47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/git/commits/91ea377ee4a28a8b3ce37cb1695c0fdccc19e98c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176821849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/branzan-pablo","id":176821849,"login":"branzan-pablo","node_id":"U_kgDOCooWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/branzan-pablo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/commit/91ea377ee4a28a8b3ce37cb1695c0fdccc19e98c","node_id":"C_kwDOQBJ8WNoAKDkxZWEzNzdlZTRhMjhhOGIzY2UzN2NiMTY5NWMwZmRjY2MxOWU5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/commit/a52a68699928cfa47e1784d3821b3dc3358e4cdc","sha":"a52a68699928cfa47e1784d3821b3dc3358e4cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/branzan-pablo/CodeFlow-/commits/a52a68699928cfa47e1784d3821b3dc3358e4cdc"}],"sha":"91ea377ee4a28a8b3ce37cb1695c0fdccc19e98c","url":"https://a