Z","email":"red1org@gmail.com","name":"Redhuan D. Oon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-19T19:24:51Z","email":"red1org@gmail.com","name":"Redhuan D. Oon"},"message":"Fix conduit diameter bug and add length reporting\n\n- Remove unit=''LENGTH'' causing diameter unit conversion issue\n- Add total conduit length print statement in generate_conduit()\n\nResolves conduit appearing as 0.1mm instead of 100mm diameter.","tree":{"sha":"2c6d253ff713ae338fbe998b260d1853800bdf2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/git/trees/2c6d253ff713ae338fbe998b260d1853800bdf2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/git/commits/29d41928538904f22f40730a7b108a466bb15589","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103561963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon","id":103561963,"login":"red1oon","node_id":"U_kgDOBiw66w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon/mep_engineering/commit/29d41928538904f22f40730a7b108a466bb15589","node_id":"C_kwDOQBLH_doAKDI5ZDQxOTI4NTM4OTA0ZjIyZjQwNzMwYTdiMTA4YTQ2NmJiMTU1ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon/mep_engineering/commit/28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109","sha":"28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/commits/28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109"}],"sha":"29d41928538904f22f40730a7b108a466bb15589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/commits/29d41928538904f22f40730a7b108a466bb15589"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103561963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon","id":103561963,"login":"red1oon","node_id":"U_kgDOBiw66w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/commits/28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-19T06:46:21Z","email":"red1org@gmail.com","name":"Redhuan D. Oon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-19T06:46:21Z","email":"red1org@gmail.com","name":"Redhuan D. Oon"},"message":"fix: Dynamic coordinate offset calculation for MEP conduit visualization\n\nPROBLEM:\n- Conduit geometry appearing kilometers away from building\n- Hardcoded offset values (-120, +20, -6) only worked for specific project\n- Different offset calculations in tool.py vs visualization.py causing misalignment\n\nSOLUTION:\n- Calculate IFC-to-Blender coordinate offset once during routing\n- Cache offset in scene properties (MEP_cached_offset) for reuse\n- Skip Type/Style objects and ghost elements at origin\n- Use same cached offset across all visualization functions\n\nCHANGES:\n- operator.py: Calculate offset from actual placed IFC geometry, cache in scene\n- tool.py: Use cached offset for conduit cylinder placement\n- visualization.py: Use cached offset for debug spheres and obstacles\n\nRESULT:\n- Conduits now appear correctly at building location\n- Works for any project coordinates without hardcoding\n- Consistent visualization across all debug objects\n\nTested on: Terminal 1 Jetty Complex (Perlis, Malaysia)\nFederation: 44,190 elements, 7 disciplines","tree":{"sha":"65f7cdb9891262a8457d79454767882cac37586e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/git/trees/65f7cdb9891262a8457d79454767882cac37586e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/git/commits/28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103561963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon","id":103561963,"login":"red1oon","node_id":"U_kgDOBiw66w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon/mep_engineering/commit/28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109","node_id":"C_kwDOQBLH_doAKDI4YzBkZDk1ZmVlNmFiZTg0ODA4NDYxZjFjYTBiN2IzNTU2MjIxMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon/mep_engineering/commit/b78c194b0a87da11d8caac6c45cd4c49feed2b3b","sha":"b78c194b0a87da11d8caac6c45cd4c49feed2b3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/commits/b78c194b0a87da11d8caac6c45cd4c49feed2b3b"}],"sha":"28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/commits/28c0dd95fee6abe84808461f1ca0b7b355622109"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103561963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon","id":103561963,"login":"red1oon","node_id":"U_kgDOBiw66w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/commits/b78c194b0a87da11d8caac6c45cd4c49feed2b3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-18T08:57:55Z","email":"red1org@gmail.com","name":"Redhuan D. Oon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-18T08:57:55Z","email":"red1org@gmail.com","name":"Redhuan D. Oon"},"message":"Refactor MEP conduit routing: Extract business logic to tool.py\n\nMajor architectural improvement following Bonsai best practices:\n\n- Extract ~500 lines of pathfinding logic from operator.py to tool.py\n- New classes: ConduitRouter, PathfindingAlgorithm, IFCGeometryGenerator, InfrastructureDetector\n- Operators now thin (~50 lines each) - validate input and call tools\n- All Federation module dependencies preserved (index.query_corridor, obstacle detection)\n- All visualization and validation operators intact\n\nBenefits:\n- Testable business logic independent of Blender\n- Clear separation: UI (operator.py) vs logic (tool.py)\n- Foundation for intelligent routing enhancements\n- Community contribution ready (follows Bonsai patterns)\n\nNew capability (Phase 1):\n- InfrastructureDetector: Identifies existing cable trays, service corridors\n- Biased RRT sampling: 70% near trays, 20% preferred height, 10% random\n- Routes now follow existing MEP infrastructure when detected\n\nNo functional regressions - all existing features work identically.\nTested with Terminal 1/2 Jetty Complex federated models.\n\nNext: Research MEP industry standards for routing constraint implementation.","tree":{"sha":"c4465b892474760ba4bfe14ddc6302be0e6e6da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/git/trees/c4465b892474760ba4bfe14ddc6302be0e6e6da0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/red1oon/mep_engineering/git/commits/b78c194b0a87da11d8caac6c45cd4c49feed2b3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103561963?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/red1oon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/red1oon","id":103561963,"login":"red1oon","node_id":"U