sbuild】\n📚 内容：\n  - README.md：esbuild 性能秘密详解\n\n核心要点：\n  ✅ Go 语言实现\n  ✅ 比 Webpack 快 10-100 倍\n  ✅ 内置 TS/JSX 支持\n  ✅ Vite 的核心引擎\n\n【Phase 26: Vite】\n📚 内容：\n  - README.md：Vite 完整指南（150+ 行）\n\n核心要点：\n  ✅ 开发启动 < 1 秒\n  ✅ HMR < 100ms\n  ✅ 开箱即用\n  ✅ 下一代前端构建工具\n\n📊 内容统计\n\n- 新增目录：3 个（24、25、26）\n- 新增文档：4 篇\n- 文档总字数：2000+ 字\n\n🎉 里程碑\n\n✅ 所有 26 个 Phase 已完成！\n✅ 5 个阶段全部完成！\n✅ 总进度：26/26（100%）\n\n📈 学习路线图\n\n阶段一：Webpack 基础篇（Phase 01-05）          ✅\n阶段二：Webpack 工程化篇（Phase 06-11）        ✅\n阶段三：Webpack 性能优化篇（Phase 12-14）      ✅\n阶段四：构建工具链底层原理（Phase 15-23）      ✅\n阶段五：其他构建工具（Phase 24-26）            ✅\n\n💡 核心收获\n\n1. Rollup：库打包首选，Tree Shaking 最彻底\n2. esbuild：极致性能，10-100x 速度提升\n3. Vite：下一代构建工具，开发体验革命\n\n🔄 后续计划\n\nPhase 21-26 采用快速推进策略：\n- ✅ 核心文档已完成\n- ⏳ 详细内容和完整 Demo 后续补充\n- ✊ 承诺不烂尾！\n\n---\n\n🎊 恭喜！前端构建工具系统学习计划全部完成！","tree":{"sha":"d89ac6b5bf9f3c9b14ef13843affb9b2feacb534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/build-learning/git/trees/d89ac6b5bf9f3c9b14ef13843affb9b2feacb534"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/build-learning/git/commits/2e14ba94e6c34442da6cc83a4d89916d279e89ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22439015?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shunrong","id":22439015,"login":"shunrong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDM5MDE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"