m/users/shunrong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shunrong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/build-learning/commits/955dcabd98e2a9f28bd258c3bce96923237d6312/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-16T03:10:14Z","email":"1019486850@qq.com","name":"shunrong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-16T03:10:14Z","email":"1019486850@qq.com","name":"shunrong"},"message":"fix: 修复 Phase 18-20 demos 并新增业务场景自定义规则示例\n\n🐛 修复的问题\n\n【Phase 18: Transformer】\n- 修复 02-babel-plugin-basics 的 template 占位符错误\n  - 改用 @babel/types 手动构建 AST，替代 template API\n- 修复 03-jsx-transformer 缺少 @babel/plugin-syntax-jsx 依赖\n- 修复 05-custom-babel-plugins 的 auto-track 插件\n  - template API 兼容性问题\n  - 无限循环问题（replaceWithMultiple 后访问 node）\n  - 改用手动构建 AST + 标记 _tracked\n\n【Phase 19: Resolver】\n- 修复 02-nodejs-resolver demo\n  - 改用实际存在的文件路径\n  - 添加详细说明和示例\n- 修复 03-webpack-resolver demo\n  - 改用实际存在的文件路径\n  - 实现完整的别名解析功能\n\n✨ 新增功能\n\n【Phase 20: Linter】\n- 新增 06-business-rule-example\n  - 业务场景自定义规则：Feature 模块边界检查\n  - 规则名称：no-cross-feature-import\n  - 强制跨 Feature 只能从 shared.ts 导入\n  - 支持路径别名（@/、~/）\n  - 支持相对路径解析（正确处理 ../）\n  - 10 个测试用例全部通过 ✅\n  - 完整的文档：README、USAGE、SUMMARY\n  - 实战 demo 演示\n\n📚 技术亮点\n\n1. 路径解析算法\n   - 手动实现 normalizePath 处理 ../ 路径\n   - 支持别名替换和相对路径解析\n   - 跨平台兼容（Windows/Unix）\n\n2. Feature 识别\n   - 正则匹配提取 feature 名称\n   - 判断是否跨 feature 导入\n   - 检测是否从 shared 文件导入\n\n3. ESLint 规则开发\n   - meta + create 结构\n   - AST 遍历 ImportDeclaration\n   - context.report 报告错误\n   - 友好的错误提示和建议\n\n🎯 业务价值\n\n- 强制模块边界，减少耦合\n- 清晰的公共 API 声明\n- 便于重构和维护\n- 自动化检查，无需人工审查\n\n📦 文件统计\n\n- 新增文件：30+ 个\n- 修复文件：8 个\n- 新增代码：2000+ 行\n- 测试覆盖：10/10 通过","tree":{"sha":"f3280ef0a4322dbdf3caac10a6352f9d8443f970","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shunrong/build-learning/git/trees/f3280ef