hi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:39:37Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"message":"fix(sst): correctWithClaude auf callLlmCli nachziehen\n\nllm-caller hat mit 8310e16 auf die Kanal-Union umgestellt (claude-cli /\ncursor-cli) und callClaudeCli entfernt. apps/sst rief die alte Funktion\nweiter auf, wodurch der Prod-Build seitdem an \"callClaudeCli is not\nexported\" scheiterte und der laufende Build vom 6. Juli eingefroren war.\n\nDer Aufruf setzt jetzt channel: \"claude-cli\"; ein Test deckt die\nKanalwahl mitsamt Modell und Effort ab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011awRDZyPK9pZwgcRyZFFWT","tree":{"sha":"d2759bcd18ae1f93accb7c60aad9632fd14fd220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/d2759bcd18ae1f93accb7c60aad9632fd14fd220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/f4127abca823241ec11f20b13cb5706dc87f0ae3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptio