fan Gojan"},"message":"fix(sst): YouTube-IDs mit fuehrendem Bindestrich binden lassen\n\nBeim Binden eines Videos spawnt validateYoutubeUrlFn get_video_details.ts\nmit der Video-ID als Positionsargument. commander liest eine ID wie\n-Gj0-EIyx6g als Option und bricht mit \"unknown option\" ab, die UI meldet\n\"Konnte Video-Details nicht laden\". Der Argumentbau liegt jetzt in\nbuildVideoDetailsArgs und setzt den --Trenner vor die ID.\n\nDer Transcript-Spawn ist nicht betroffen: commander nimmt bei\n--video-id <id> auch Werte mit fuehrendem Bindestrich an (an commander 14\ngeprueft).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011awRDZyPK9pZwgcRyZFFWT","tree":{"sha":"37d4efab250f16e63746c760f85a1ae0198c873a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/37d4efab250f16e63746c760f85a1ae0198c873a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/5250af52a2544796a432408ed12502e70442f09a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/5250af52a2544796a432408ed12502e70442f09a","node_id":"C_kwDOQBfJy9oAKDUyNTBhZjUyYTI1NDQ3OTZhNDMyNDA4ZWQxMjUwMmU3MDQ0MmYwOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe","sha":"fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe"}],"sha":"5250af52a2544796a432408ed12502e70442f09a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/5250af52a2544796a432408ed12502e70442f09a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:50:31Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:39:37Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"message":"fix(yt-notes): pass 5 verlor die erste Sektion durch verklebte Vorrede\n\nGemessen an cursor-agent 2026.08.11-e8db854: das Feld `result` von\n`--output-format json` ist exakt `assistant-Bloecke.join(\"\")` — ohne\nTrennzeichen. Ein Modell, das vor jedem Werkzeug-Aufruf einen Satz sagt,\nliefert dort `…Satz drei.## Worum es geht`. `findH2Sections` erkennt eine\nUeberschrift nur am Zeilenanfang, `assembleEnrichedBody` verwirft die Sektion\ndaraufhin ersatzlos — in der Vault-Datei zu Video qnIu-Xu64H0 fehlte\n`## Worum es geht`, die uebrigen fuenf Sektionen kamen an.\n\nZwei Stufen dagegen:\n\n1. Der cursor-Kanal liest jetzt `stream-json` statt `json`. Dort liegen die\n   Bloecke getrennt vor; `parseCursorCliStream` nimmt nur, was der Agent nach\n   seinem letzten Werkzeug-Aufruf gesagt hat, und trennt mehrere Bloecke dort\n   mit Zeilenumbruch. Der Parser haengt jetzt am Kanal (`parseOutput` in\n   SpawnCliParams) statt fest im Spawn-Code.\n2. `dropPreambleBeforeFirstH2` in pass5-sanitize.ts verwirft deterministisch\n   alles vor der ersten `## `-Ueberschrift und heilt den fehlenden\n   Zeilenumbruch, auch wenn die Ueberschrift mitten in einer Zeile klebt.\n   Laeuft in enrich-pipeline.ts vor stripLinkBackticks und damit vor\n   assembleEnrichedBody. Fence-Logik und `###`-Abgrenzung wie in\n   findH2Sections, damit beide dieselbe erste Ueberschrift sehen.\n\nStufe 2 bleibt noetig, wenn Stufe 1 greift: die Schlussnachricht selbst kann\nVorrede enthalten.\n\nRegressionstests fuer beide Stufen mit dem Ausgabe-Anfang aus dem Lauf zu\nqnIu-Xu64H0 als Eingabefall. Prompt-Text von buildPass5Prompt unveraendert.","tree":{"sha":"e594bebc309aeb46296dcf42bf9967869cd212cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/e594bebc309aeb46296dcf42bf9967869cd212cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe","node_id":"C_kwDOQBfJy9oAKGZjZWQxZDM5ZTM2NDVlZGZjMzM4M2EzY2NlOTcxMWIwYzljNTM3ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/0700762761b31c4ec672f3964e343d62fe3a999d","sha":"0700762761b31c4ec672f3964e343d62fe3a999d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/0700762761b31c4ec672f3964e343d62fe3a999d"}],"sha":"fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/fced1d39e3645edfc3383a3cce9711b0c9c537fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/0700762761b31c4ec672f3964e343d62fe3a999d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:13:37Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:39:37Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"message":"feat(yt-notes): switch pass 5 to cursor-agent on grok 4.6 xhigh\n\nBeleg ist die 16-Video-Vergleichsmessung in\ndocs/measurements/2026-08-23-pass5-grok46-vs-opus5/BERICHT.md: Grok 4.6 xhigh\ngewinnt Vollstaendigkeit einstimmig ueber zwei verblindete Richter, Praezision\ndeutlich, setzt 182 statt 95 auflösbare Vault-Links und haelt das\nWikilink-Verfahren in 16 von 16 Laeufen ein.\n\nllm-caller.ts bekommt dafuer einen zweiten Kanal. LlmCallOptions ist jetzt eine\nUnion ueber `channel`; Modell und Reasoning-Stufe bleiben in beiden Zweigen\nPflichtfelder. Beim cursor-Kanal steckt die Stufe im Modell-Slug, deshalb setzt\nbuildCursorModelSlug ihn aus Basis + Stufe zusammen — sonst waere `xhigh` ein\nTextbestandteil, den eine Aufrufstelle stillschweigend uebernehmen kann.\nPass 1-4 bleiben unveraendert auf ihren Modellen und auf `claude --print`; nur\nder Kanal steht dort jetzt als Literal am Aufruf.\n\nWerkzeug-Schranke: die Cursor CLI hat kein Gegenstueck zu\n`--allowed-tools \"Bash(...)\"`, das traegt. Gemessen mit cursor-agent\n2026.08.11-e8db854: `permissions.deny` wird vor jeder Allowlist geprueft und\nkann deshalb kein \"alles ausser diesem einen\" ausdruecken, und\n`approvalMode: allowlist` laesst eingebaut-harmlose Befehle wie `echo` unter\n`--print` trotzdem laufen. Tragend sind stattdessen zwei fail-closed-Hooks in\neinem Wegwerf-Arbeitsverzeichnis, bedient von cursor-agent-guard.ts:\npreToolUse laesst nur das Shell-Werkzeug durch, beforeShellExecution nur\nBefehle mit einem der drei OHS-Praefixe und ohne Verkettung. Dazu ein eigenes\nCURSOR_CONFIG_DIR je Aufruf, damit der Lauf nicht an der interaktiven\nCursor-Konfiguration haengt und keine MCP-Werkzeuge bekommt.\n\nZeitlimit des cursor-Kanals 20 min statt 10: die Messung sah Laeufe bis 696 s,\nder bisherige Wert haette den langsamsten abgeschnitten.\n\nPrompt-Text von buildPass5Prompt, Retry-Schleife und Nachbearbeitung in\nenrich-pipeline.ts bleiben unangetastet.","tree":{"sha":"7ada0bec39f887ab28f57c9f696238ea760bf4fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/7ada0bec39f887ab28f57c9f696238ea760bf4fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/0700762761b31c4ec672f3964e343d62fe3a999d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_