ommitter":{"date":"2026-08-12T15:40:41Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"message":"fix(yt-notes): pin pass 1 to claude-opus-5 and stop auditModel drift\n\nPass 1 called the CLI alias \"opus\", which resolves through\n~/.claude/settings.json modelAliases. The pipeline could not know which\nmodel actually ran, so Transcript.auditModel carried a hardcoded\n\"claude-opus-4-8\" while the alias pointed at claude-opus-4-7 — the\nprovenance field logged a model that never ran.\n\nBoth the call and the provenance field now read PASS1_AUDIT_MODEL,\npinned to the full id claude-opus-5. Effort stays \"low\": the pass is\nmechanical section-splitting, and the ladder assigns effort by task\nclass, not by model.","tree":{"sha":"229d2cc2b90ab9c8e243ee6a53b2911a81ec2b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/229d2cc2b90ab9c8e243ee6a53b2911a81ec2b7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/892989bec12f4823de12c54a61f356f9003d378a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a