tar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/409534d7ce4af06c4245874fe6d52481469a1c4d","node_id":"C_kwDOQBfJy9oAKDQwOTUzNGQ3Y2U0YWYwNmM0MjQ1ODc0ZmU2ZDUyNDgxNDY5YTFjNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/f4efa122bae96dce6cae9806010dd805858fc596","sha":"f4efa122bae96dce6cae9806010dd805858fc596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/f4efa122bae96dce6cae9806010dd805858fc596"}],"sha":"409534d7ce4af06c4245874fe6d52481469a1c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/409534d7ce4af06c4245874fe6d52481469a1c4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/f4efa122bae96dce6cae9806010dd805858fc596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:08:10Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:08:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Financy with Tanstack Start, delete buggy NextJS version (#21)\n\n* ignore .claude\n\n* ai plan\n\n* docs(plan): align financy tanstack migration decisions\n\n* feat(financy): rename legacy app and scaffold TanStack target\n\n* feat(financy): add tanstack shell, route skeletons, and domain modules\n\n* feat(financy): port db and data layer into src/server\n\n* feat(financy): wire dashboard and current-edit to server actions\n\n* feat(financy): connect forecast and settings to server data\n\n* feat(financy): redirect root route to dashboard\n\n* chore(financy): remove switch-test leftovers from scaffold\n\n* feat(financy): add interactive forecast save editor\n\n* ignore playwright\n\n* feat(financy): restore legacy shadcn layout and styling parity\n\n* fix(financy): restore forecast timeline flow and settings sorting\n\n* chore: commit current parity test adjustments\n\n* chore: persist updated plan state\n\n* plan changes\n\n* feat(financy): disable SSR default and add request flow debug traces\n\n* fix(financy): allow independent settings scenario toggles\n\n* chore(financy-forecast): add db pool diagnostics for dev connection debugging\n\n* docs(current): close financy migration plan\n\n* feat(financy-forecast): add route pending/error states and finalize step-7 validation\n\n* change plan\n\n* feat(financy-forecast): complete migration cutover - remove legacy Next.js app\n\n- Remove apps/financy-forecast-next directory entirely\n- Update root README.md to reflect TanStack app as primary\n- Mark current/plan.md as completed on 2026-05-04\n- All 8 migration steps implemented and validated\n\n* bun lockfile fix\n\n* fix deps\n\n* fix: align spinner typing with Loader2Icon\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- use explicit React ComponentProps import instead of implicit React namespace usage\n- remove ramda omit workaround and forward icon props with correct types\n\n* fix: harden current-balance and forecast save flows\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- parse and coerce CurrentEdit date fields at route boundary with zod schemas\n- block current-balance save when parse errors are present and keep invalid fields marked\n- use typed CurrentBalanceParseError instead of generic Error for parse failures\n- make forecast settings+scenario updates atomic in one database transaction\n- simplify Option-to-null mapping with Option.getOrNull\n- reuse postgres pool via globalThis to avoid duplicate pools on module re-evaluation\n\n* fix: improve sidebar matching and UI accessibility states\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- avoid active-link false positives by requiring descendant path boundary matching\n- announce matrix approval errors via alert live region\n- expose matrix pending state accessibly via dynamic aria-label and aria-busy\n- extract settings scenario toggle logic into a named handler\n- remove stale Next.js use-client directive from forecast state module\n- use event.currentTarget.value consistently in forecast input handling\n- hoist loop-invariant forecast month computation outside the timeline loop\n\n* fix: harden app metadata and runtime configuration\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- pin nitro dependency to a deterministic semver range\n- update manifest app names from scaffold placeholders to Financy values\n- block crawler indexing explicitly in robots.txt with Disallow: /\n- refresh README wording to reflect completed TanStack cutover\n- gate TanStack devtools to development builds only\n- use explicit fritz.box suffix check for vite allowed hosts\n\n* test: cover now-dependent snapshot domain behavior\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- add snapshots domain tests for calculateApprovable around threshold boundaries\n- add calculateInitialSnapshotDate tests for mocked now and explicit reference dates\n\n* refactor: remove unused ForecastEditor component\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- remove dead ForecastEditor code path to avoid stale local state risk after invalidation\n- keep active forecast flow in forecastState-based components only\n\n* fix: address latest coderabbit review findings\n\n- use UPPER_SNAKE_CASE debug constant in dashboard route\n- broaden app env gitignore patterns while keeping templates tracked\n- switch CurrentEdit to dirty override state and reset after successful save\n- announce settings toggle failures via alert live region\n- persist sidebar cookie from committed open state\n- deduplicate mockedNow lifecycle hooks in snapshots tests\n- use import.meta.env.DEV in root route\n- reserve db connection in executeWithSchema so search_path and query share one connection\n- reject DATABASE_URL values containing prisma-style schema query param\n\n* cleanup\n\n* fix: submit only dirty current balance overrides\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- Send only dirty `valuesByAccountId` entries in CurrentEdit save flow to avoid touching untouched accounts\n\n* fix: split expected scenario toggle errors from runtime failures\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- Return expected business error for missing scenario instead of treating all failures as inline UI errors\n- Propagate unexpected toggle failures instead of swallowing them in SettingsScenariosTable\n\n* chore: remove non-build env vars from turbo globalEnv\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/21:\n- Remove FRITZBOX_DEVICE_HOSTNAME from globalEnv because it only affects dev runtime host config\n- Remove DEV from globalEnv because the app uses Vite import.meta.env constants","tree":{"sha":"dfbca67367c5c7e2da7e03706d92767d2bea6f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/dfbca67367c5c7e2da7e03706d92767d2bea6f3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/f4efa122bae96dce6cae9806010dd805858fc596","verification":{"payload":"tree dfbca67367c5c7e2da7e03706d92767d2bea6f3f\nparent 0b3c426cc80bac810df29d3de2b10bca91c52cd8\nauthor Stefan Gojan <vollekannehoschi@gmail.com> 1778407690 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778407690 +0200\n\nFinancy with Tanstack Start, delete buggy NextJS version (#21)\n\n* ignore .claude\n\n* ai plan\n\n* docs(plan): align financy tanstack migration decisions\n\n* feat(financy): rename legacy app and scaffold TanStack target\n\n* feat(financy): add tanstack shell, route skeletons, and domain modules\n\n* feat(financy): port db and data layer into src/server\n\n* feat(financy): wire dashboard and current-edit to server actions\n\n* feat(financy): connect forecast and settings to server data\n\n* feat(financy): redirect root route to dashboard\n\n* chore(financy): remove switch-test leftovers from scaffold\n\n* feat(financy): add int