users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/24dbc423664a1d8357d389a882128b151e9d892c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T10:33:42Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T10:46:39Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"message":"Mail agent (#20)\n\n* add infos for feature\n\n* init plan\n\n* updates\n\n* manual tests\n\n* more infos\n\n* chore(mail-agent): scaffold workspace and runtime contracts\n\n* feat(mail-agent): add prisma setup and initial mail schema\n\n* docs(plan): add final smoke-test cleanup step\n\n* feat(mail-agent): add fail-fast env configuration and bootstrap\n\n* feat(mail-agent): implement gmail polling and cursor sync\n\n* chore(mail-agent): add smoke clean reset script\n\n* fixes\n\n* fixes for ai steps for google console\n\n* fixes\n\n* fixes\n\n* oh boy\n\n* alter\n\n* debug\n\n* label fixes\n\n* cursor clarifications\n\n* fix env example\n\n* doc fix\n\n* step 7, first try\n\n* try 2\n\n* http service split\n\n* fixes\n\n* fix filter\n\n* notification in db\n\n* last steps\n\n* fix telegram docu\n\n* telegram formatting problems\n\n* prompt\n\n* links in msgs tests\n\n* fix\n\n* telegramm now working\n\n* process all instead of only one\n\n* add reason\n\n* remove parse mode\n\n* fix message order\n\n* shorten\n\n* docs for bugs\n\n* more logging for candidates\n\n* clean command\n\n* fix filter\n\n* fix polling\n\n* 10min default\n\n* debug candidates\n\n* fix debug\n\n* use filter also during polling\n\n* id filter fix\n\n* personal filter fix\n\n* fix hidden label problems\n\n* less logging\n\n* log snooze error\n\n* remove smoke tests, plan finished\n\n* remove plan\n\n* fixes\n\n* fix: handle hidden action and cursor persistence\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/20:\n- Add support for hidden action in undo service and Gmail undo logic\n- Move cursor persistence after message processing to prevent data loss\n- Fix undo token validation to enforce exactly two parts and improve HMAC verification\n\n* fix: memory leaks and persistence ordering issues\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/20:\n- Remove memory leak arrays that grow forever (pollCycleSummary, processedOutcomeSample)\n- Remove production subject dump and 3-second pause debugging artifact\n- Make repeated full-sync detection actually change state by persisting cursor\n\n* refactor: improve error handling and type safety\n\nAddresses PR review feedback from https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/pull/20:\n- Fix unhandled rejection in refresh token CLI by logging and exiting instead of throwing\n- Use ts-pattern with exhaustive() for UndoServiceResult dispatch to prevent silent fall-through\n- Add ts-pattern dependency for compile-time exhaustive matching guarantees\n\n* fix: AI prompt format and remove test file\n\n- Fix AI prompt format (remove leading #=)\n- Remove deleted test file from git tracking\n- Update bun.lock for ts-pattern dependency\n\n* fix: update test script to echo no tests\n\n* syncpack fix\n\n* fix: update ts-pattern version to match syncpack\n\n* fix: add path property to ClassifierDecision for private bypass detection\n\n- Add optional path property to ClassifierDecision type\n- Set path=\"private_bypass\" in buildPrivateBypassDecision\n- Update applyAction to use decision.path instead of decision.reason for private bypass detection\n- This fixes the unreachable private bypass branch in Gmail action logic\n\n---------","tree":{"sha":"59bdc0b6f11dc811259f70fa001a921e625fecfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/59bdc0b6f11dc811259f70fa001a921e625fecfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/24dbc423664a1d8357d389a882128b151e9d892c","verification