chi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/56e264003e23d58711dec6281c86dab87f3335b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T13:21:05Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T13:21:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(box-storage): apply ts-pattern patterns and add auth test coverage (#15)\n\n- Refactor auth, route, dashboard, table-view, and data action branches to use\n  `ts-pattern` with clearer typed matching.\n- Improve list filtering by trimming `searchText`/`locationFilter` and using\n  typed Prisma `where` conditions.\n- Simplify item in-motion and update flows with exhaustive match-based logic and\n  explicit not-found/authorization handling.\n- Add `apps/box-storage/src/lib/auth.test.ts` with Bun mocks for auth redirects,\n  Clerk username caching, and cache eviction behavior.\n- Update `apps/box-storage/package.json` test script to `bun test`, add Bun/Node\n  types in `tsconfig`, and refresh `bun.lock`.\n- Refactor `scripts/seed-dev.ts` command handling to `match(...)` and clean up\n  room/floor logging output.\n- Sync `main-rules.md` in `.kilocode`, `.roo`, and `ai-assistants` with an\n  extensive `ts-pattern` do/don''t guide and examples.","tree":{"sha":"2fe5a2666205716788542f227fafba1d29325a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/2fe5a2666205716788542f227fafba1d29325a26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/56e264003e23d58711dec6281c86dab8