ce parsing, current edit data/action flow,\nand snapshot total-balance calculation.\nUpdate requirements/rules docs and AI docs fetch config to include Effect docs.","tree":{"sha":"bc502cbe048bc135d6d2f7414f5046a88cf2f0fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/bc502cbe048bc135d6d2f7414f5046a88cf2f0fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/90793225b40c2edfe0ac3e37ae52fadde7b5d4ff","verification":{"payload":"tree bc502cbe048bc135d6d2f7414f5046a88cf2f0fc\nparent 940d26d29bcd6aad7bc2eba7da17beafba764766\nauthor Stefan Gojan <vollekannehoschi@gmail.com> 1771055783 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771055783 +0100\n\nfeat(financy-forecast): add editable current balances workflow (#14)\n\nAdd `/current/edit` page and `CurrentEdit` UI to compare latest snapshot\nbalances with current account values and show live deltas.\nSupport localized number input parsing (`de`/`en` separators) and display\nvalidation errors in-form via `useActionState`.\nAdd `handleSaveCurrentBalances` server action with zod validation,\n`updateTag(\"accounts\")`, and redirect on successful save.\nImplement transactional DB updates for current balances, update `updated_at`\nonly on real changes, and expose `updatedAt` in account schema/types/queries.\nFix matrix totals to sum account balances consistently (including snapshots),\nadd edit shortcut from `Current`, and extract shared format helpers.\nExpand tests for formatting, balance parsing, current edit data/action flow,\nand snapshot total-balance calculation.\nUpdate requirements/rules docs and AI docs fetch config to include Effect docs.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpkCqnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOUEQADzjaacPxWMsaayZnkgsizVw\nwwuCdQqCwtLuYoR/TWKapLfdC7MdlN/EhfIsPELOQ9vO9wynj/banVPTQn2nNNYF\n4YdJvAB42V/pKN9BI6ZQBKhE7dx/VqiTCimZC5jriwSX7YZPBt0+0s0kYYNV6q5D\ndQN8GkJOWC6B4gDmA52Y3r7+4S5NsYtAGnOGwApIDDalbUIwiZRV2NzgdlXK7VxC\n