0d26d29bcd6aad7bc2eba7da17beafba764766","node_id":"C_kwDOQBfJy9oAKDk0MGQyNmQyOWJjZDZhYWQ3YmMyZWJhN2RhMTdiZWFmYmE3NjQ3NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/edf2ca6d79b7d5649f69134a782d1d4d074411f5","sha":"edf2ca6d79b7d5649f69134a782d1d4d074411f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/edf2ca6d79b7d5649f69134a782d1d4d074411f5"}],"sha":"940d26d29bcd6aad7bc2eba7da17beafba764766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/940d26d29bcd6aad7bc2eba7da17beafba764766"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/edf2ca6d79b7d5649f69134a782d1d4d074411f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T12:35:12Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T12:35:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(financy-forecast): harden snapshot approval flow and add global fallback error boundary (#13)\n\n- Separate snapshot approval concerns: keep business logic in\n  `handleApproveSnapshot` (server) and form/UI handling in `approveAction`.\n- Extract and centralize snapshot date rules in domain helpers:\n  `calculateEarliestApprovalDate`, `calculateInitialSnapshotDate`,\n  `calculateNextSnapshotDate`.\n- Improve matrix behavior for onboarding users: return matrix data with current\n  balances even when snapshots are missing; keep `Option.none` only when no\n  usable data exists.\n- Update matrix delta presentation: keep monthly deltas color-coded and show\n  the total change from first snapshot to current in the last column.\n- Replace brittle message-based error handling with typed errors:\n  `SnapshotNotApprovableError` and `NoAccountsAvailableError`.\n- Improve DB approval transaction robustness and efficiency: remove unused\n  `RETURNING` in snapshot detail inserts and propagate typed no-account errors.\n- Prevent accidental mutation in data assembly by replacing `reverse()` with\n  `toReversed()`.\n- Add a simple global last-resort error boundary via\n  `app/global-error.tsx` with reset action.\n- Extend tests for snapshot domain helpers and approval action behavior,\n  including deterministic initial-date checks via mocked `now()`.","tree":{"sha":"c687f79a0e325b5853b4c3b461de0a58b852a2a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/c687f79a0e325b5853b4c3b461de0a58b852a2a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/edf2ca6d79b7d5649f69134a782d1d4d074411f5","verification":{"payload":"tree c687f79a0e325b5853b4c3b461de0a58b852a2a7\nparent e565361f08080603976e9dd29eefacd1d6df5c5f\nauthor Stefan Gojan <vollekannehoschi@gmail.com> 1770899712 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770899712 +0100\n\nfeat(financy-forecast): harden snapshot approval flow and add global fallback error boundary (#13)\n\n- Separate snapshot approval concerns: keep business logic in\n  `handleApproveSnapshot` (server) and form/UI handling in `approveAction`.\n- Extract and centralize snapshot date rules in domain helpers:\n  `calculateEarliestApprovalDate`, `calculateInitialSnapshotDate`,\n  `calculateNextSnapshotDate`.\n- Improve matrix behavior for onboarding users: return matrix data with current\n  balances even when snapshots are missing; keep `Option.none` only when no\n  usable data exists.\n- Update matrix delta presentation: keep monthly deltas color-coded and show\n  the total change from first snapshot to current in the last column.\n- Replace brittle message-based error handling with typed errors:\n  `SnapshotNotApprovableError` and `NoAccountsAvailableError`.\n- Improve DB approval transaction robustness and efficiency: remove unused\n  `RETURNING` in snapshot detail inserts and propagate typed no-account errors.\n- Prevent accidental mutation in data assembly by replacing `reverse()` with\n  `toReversed()`.\n- Add a simple global last-resort error boundary via\n  `app/global-error.tsx` with reset action.\n- Extend tests for snapshot domain helpers and approval action behavior,\n  including deterministic initial-date checks via mocked `now()`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjckACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT+UQAGhXm5XkzWtPwndzNZg4gz+q\nJHajC/CjQeIUoUzp+2lzQFKHnJGVvx2G2zoJfVquzy+RxFVYnf6ExIwN7sjInBsd\nXbQfBhhWm1xLweCBSc2LgQmBa8jZp2mB13hFBRAQ8NlywIUOcDt/QpHDIlHVDmdi\nPXyPH8aIbbJ/xzvI48xdj0JL4IGBtEgrVLfQtSvuipGJk9gU+Y6ZBi4mVw2rqJxF\nJGFCCHF9ZhNxA0wOzFY5KGxp2dhDw1AKfInGcPA8qePkZEiwg9v8lAc3gCuWBpQ2\n8F1y4+s94bVAHxbSkNxoMWlCbV1EERBYJbELhYNnTovwtiVxaRnuy/8KkCuICS2x\ndASnr1YywNn1JCiWPw915JOEPqbUMl+gs2hA4gw1tSK39PkgYlWPRQjHi5fC2V0E\nTP10M8YGGVjs3Riv7VDpkbqRYUuqGxqCJGiZGIxv45xW0roabTV3yJsQUY7ywKpJ\nMk9F6aWymmt4NncxQT/EKY9hNs7FrTCpn+0KB7bJddW1nX0FbKKgVd4NYDaeeDjC\negeqiPh+AZ4BJ+yy+9w934YFrqySs9x4Hs8eBPlj2Qo+Yq1DQHsdm3aH1y7BzpMm\nso8dqeo1isb1jF03lei5+IqT20lWV/905BLbDgHJap3TwdkLPj98FESjrhcmQ8sx\nfWMxnGvyBnjkxNs4+Dwz\n=re1b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"202