ithub.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/e565361f08080603976e9dd29eefacd1d6df5c5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T16:18:34Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T09:43:13Z","email":"vollekannehoschi@gmail.com","name":"Stefan Gojan"},"message":"Clerk auth migration: remove User model, store usernames, update auth flow, seed data, docs, and tooling (#11)\n\n- Switched authentication to Clerk: `ClerkProvider`, `clerkMiddleware`, sign-in/sign-up UI in the header, and `useUser`/`useUserId` for client logic.\n- Prisma schema updated: removed `User` model, user IDs stored as strings, added `ownerUsername`, `inMotionUsername`, `userUsername`, and aligned Zod schemas.\n- Server actions now use `authStateFn`, removed login fn, added ownership check in `updateItemFn`, and wrapped Zod validators to avoid the `.parse` binding bug.\n- Seed script migrated to Clerk user IDs/usernames, removed bcrypt, populated `userUsername`/ownership fields, and ensured `alice` is actually used.\n- UI updates: dashboard shows `ownerUsername` directly; table view uses `useUserId`.\n- Docs/config: README updated for Clerk, `.env.example` now contains Clerk keys, and `main-rules.md` extended.\n- Infra/tooling: Vite resolve alias for `use-sync-external-store`, legacy auth middleware deleted, dependencies updated (Clerk added, bcrypt removed), `apps/rest-server/eslint.config.js` moved to base config, `.gitignore` expanded.\n- Prisma migrations added for User removal and Clerk username backfill/NOT NULL enforcement; `bun.lock` updated.","tree":{"sha":"d8fa0049fbc2c9d17fb7f3cdc33d35a1d39621d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/trees/d8fa0049fbc2c9d17fb7f3cdc33d35a1d39621d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/git/commits/e565361f08080603976e9dd29eefacd1d6df5c5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163128?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi","id":163128,"login":"hoschi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzEyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoschi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/e565361f08080603976e9dd29eefacd1d6df5c5f","node_id":"C_kwDOQBfJy9oAKGU1NjUzNjFmMDgwODA2MDM5NzZlOWRkMjllZWZhY2QxZDZkZjVjNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commit/042b6a073278d78045ad92769a2f78981bb3c85e","sha":"042b6a073278d78045ad92769a2f78981bb3c85e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoschi/all-personal-projects/commits/042b6a073278d78045ad92769a2f78981bb3c85e"}],"sha":"e565361f080806