},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/e84c8e5a413e83e502f56eb84f93d7d44926462a","node_id":"C_kwDOQBoD2toAKGU4NGM4ZTVhNDEzZTgzZTUwMmY1NmViODRmOTNkN2Q0NDkyNjQ2MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df","sha":"f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df"}],"sha":"e84c8e5a413e83e502f56eb84f93d7d44926462a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/e84c8e5a413e83e502f56eb84f93d7d44926462a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T14:35:22Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T14:35:22Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Phase 1: Add database-backed pattern management system with tracking\n\nImplemented comprehensive pattern management system that stores sentiment patterns in PostgreSQL database instead of text files, with full tracking of pattern matches over time.\n\n**Database Schema:**\n- Added `patterns` table for storing sentiment patterns\n  - Fields: pattern_text, sentiment_type, is_active, match_count\n  - Timestamps: created_at, updated_at, last_matched_at\n  - Metadata: added_by, notes\n  - Indexed for performance (pattern_text, sentiment_type, is_active)\n\n- Added `pattern_matches` table for tracking every pattern detection\n  - Links to: pattern_id, job_id, sentiment_result_id\n  - Captures: matched_text, competitor_name, segment times\n  - Timestamp: detected_at (for date filtering)\n  - Enables analytics on pattern usage over time\n\n**API Endpoints (Orchestrator /patterns):**\n\nCRUD Operations:\n- GET /patterns - List all patterns with filtering\n- GET /patterns/{id} - Get specific pattern\n- POST /patterns - Create new pattern\n- POST /patterns/bulk - Bulk create patterns\n- PUT /patterns/{id} - Update pattern\n- DELETE /patterns/{id} - Delete pattern\n- DELETE /patterns/by-text/{type}/{text} - Delete by text (backward compat)\n\nMatch Tracking:\n- GET /patterns/{id}/matches - Get all matches for a pattern with date filtering\n\nAnalytics:\n- GET /patterns/analytics/overview - Overall pattern statistics\n- GET /patterns/analytics/pattern/{id} - Detailed pattern analytics\n  - Matches by date (daily aggregation)\n  - Top competitors mentioning this pattern\n  - Average matches per day\n- GET /patterns/analytics/trending - Most matched patterns in recent days\n\n**Migration Tools:**\n- Created Alembic migration (003_add_pattern_tables.py)\n- Import script (scripts/import_patterns_from_files.py) to migrate from text files\n- Supports importing existing positive_patterns.txt and negative_patterns.txt\n\n**Features:**\n- Pattern match counter (cached in patterns.match_count for performance)\n- Date-based filtering for all analytics\n- Soft delete capability (is_active flag)\n- Pattern uniqueness enforced at database level\n- Full relationship mapping (patterns → matches → sentiment_results → jobs)\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Track which patterns are most effective\n- Identify patterns that are never matched\n- Analyze pattern usage trends over time\n- Filter pattern analytics by date range\n- Link patterns to specific jobs and competitors\n- Maintain pattern history even when patterns are deleted\n\n**Next Phase:**\n- Update sentiment service to read from database via API\n- Add automatic pattern match tracking during sentiment analysis\n- Update PHP frontend for pattern management with analytics\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"606a19fdcf4b91e9e99ed12cb4fae01edf6203f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/606a19fdcf4b91e9e99ed12cb4fae01edf6203f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df","node_id":"C_kwDOQBoD2toAKGY2YWFlMjU3MmRkZGYyNjM3Mjc3MzczMmI1MDE5OGFhMjEyYTUzZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5","sha":"cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5"}],"sha":"f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/f6aae2572dddf26372773732b50198aa212a53df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:52:58Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:52:58Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Fix analytics data display and improve styling in PHP frontend\n\nFixed critical data display issues and significantly improved the visual design of the analytics dashboard.\n\n**Data Display Fixes:**\n- Fixed sentiment distribution parsing - API returns array format not dictionary\n- Added helper functions to convert API array responses to usable format\n- Fixed total mentions calculation from sentiment_distribution array\n- Fixed unique competitors display using correct API field\n- Fixed per-competitor sentiment counts display using sentiment_breakdown\n- All analytics now properly display positive/negative/neutral counts with percentages\n\n**Styling Improvements:**\n- Added gradient stat cards for overview metrics (Total Jobs, Competitors, Mentions)\n- Enhanced sentiment cards with color-coded left borders and percentages\n- Improved competitor details section with bordered highlight background\n- Added gradient navigation bar with hover effects\n- Enhanced card styling with shadows and hover animations\n- Added gradient text effect to h1 headings\n- Improved responsive grid layout for better mobile support\n- Better visual hierarchy and spacing throughout\n\n**Technical Changes:**\n- Created processSentimentDistribution() to handle overview API response\n- Created processSentimentBreakdown() to handle competitor detail API response\n- Fixed data extraction from nested API response structures\n- Improved competitor table styling with badge-style mention counts\n- Added emoji indicator to competitor detail header\n\nThe analytics page now correctly displays all data from the PostgreSQL database via the Orchestrator API and has a modern, professional appearance.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0f4bc51698f0d9047a45d611f9a6056c1bcb519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/d0f4bc51698f0d9047a45d611f9a6056c1bcb519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5","node_id":"C_kwDOQBoD2toAKGNkNWViMTIxMmIzMzk0ODUzNDY2YTdmYzNlNTE2MzI1YThmMmVjYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21","sha":"0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21"}],"sha":"cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/cd5eb1212b3394853466a7fc3e516325a8f2eca5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:37:10Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:37:10Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Add API connectivity verification and documentation for PHP frontend\n\nAdded comprehensive API connectivity testing and improved documentation to ensure the PHP frontend properly accesses all backend services and database information.\n\nChanges:\n- Created test-api.php page to verify connectivity to all API endpoints\n  - Tests Orchestrator API (jobs, analytics, admin, storage endpoints)\n  - Tests Sentiment API (pattern management endpoints)\n  - Shows response times, data counts, and full response payloads\n  - Displays PHP configuration (cURL, upload limits, etc.)\n\n- Added \"Test API\" link to navigation header for easy access\n\n- Enhanced README.md with detailed API connectivity documentation\n  - Explained internal Docker network vs external access\n  - Listed all API endpoints the frontend uses\n  - Documented data sources (PostgreSQL, MinIO, Redis via APIs)\n  - Added troubleshooting section for API connectivity\n\nAPI Configuration:\n- Orchestrator API: http://orchestrator-api:8000 (internal Docker network)\n- Sentiment API: http://sentiment-api:8008 (internal Docker network)\n- Frontend accesses the SAME data as Svelte frontend:\n  - Jobs and status from PostgreSQL via Orchestrator\n  - Sentiment results from PostgreSQL via Orchestrator\n  - Analytics aggregations from Orchestrator\n  - Pattern files from Sentiment API\n  - Storage files from MinIO via Orchestrator proxy\n\nThe PHP frontend is now fully connected to all backend services and can access all database information that the Svelte frontend uses.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f0f9daad6294fef07adbeaf67c3fb9fafe96650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/1f0f9daad6294fef07adbeaf67c3fb9fafe96650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21","node_id":"C_kwDOQBoD2toAKDBmMzZiN2QyM2M2MmFmOGY3MjM1MGUyN2Y1ZDIyZTM4M2NhYWZhMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a","sha":"a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a"}],"sha":"0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/0f36b7d23c62af8f72350e27f5d22e383caafa21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:29:10Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:29:10Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Add PHP frontend to main docker-compose configuration\n\nIntegrated the PHP frontend service into the main docker-compose.yml file so it builds alongside all other microservices.\n\nChanges:\n- Added frontend-php service definition\n- Configured to use internal Docker network URLs for API communication\n- Set port 3210 to avoid conflict with Svelte frontend (port 3200)\n- Added volume mounts for live code updates during development\n- Configured depends_on for orchestrator-api and sentiment-api\n- Set restart policy to unless-stopped\n\nThe PHP frontend will now automatically start when running:\ndocker-compose up -d --build\n\nAccessible at: http://localhost:3210\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e0b94da0135bf1e5ca8a72a826647c4c4ec289a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/9e0b94da0135bf1e5ca8a72a826647c4c4ec289a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a","node_id":"C_kwDOQBoD2toAKGE2MWRhZDliNGVjZDU5M2NkMTMxZmYzNWYzNzFjNDVhODVkNWZlM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commit/c607369fe2cd79a93ead2a24eb880bd1afaedcd5","sha":"c607369fe2cd79a93ead2a24eb880bd1afaedcd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/c607369fe2cd79a93ead2a24eb880bd1afaedcd5"}],"sha":"a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/a61dad9b4ecd593cd131ff35f371c45a85d5fe3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/c607369fe2cd79a93ead2a24eb880bd1afaedcd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:21:20Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T12:21:20Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Add PHP + HTML frontend implementation to replace Svelte\n\nImplemented a complete PHP-based frontend as an alternative to the Svelte version, using PHP 8.2 + Apache with minimal JavaScript for AJAX polling.\n\nFeatures:\n- Home page with audio upload and job listing with auto-refresh\n- Job details page with real-time progress tracking via AJAX polling\n- Analytics dashboard with date filtering and competitor analysis\n- Pattern management with CRUD operations and bulk upload/delete\n- Admin database viewer with tabs, search, and JSON export\n\nTechnical details:\n- PHP 8.2 with Apache web server\n- Pico CSS for styling (framework-agnostic)\n- ApiClient class for REST API communication via cURL\n- JavaScript only for polling, search, and interactive features\n- Docker containerization with port 3210\n- Maintains feature parity with original Svelte implementation\n\nAPI Integration:\n- Orchestrator API (port 8100) for job management and analytics\n- Sentiment API (port 8008) for pattern management\n- File upload support up to 500MB\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1677f7016de521894b6a7e38d6388afb3cbd290b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/1677f7016de521894b6a7e38d6388afb3cbd290b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/c607369fe2cd79a93ead2a24eb880bd1afaedcd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":1353