alysis Tool:\n- Add logic to skip single-word segments during analysis\n- Single-word segments are too short for meaningful sentiment analysis\n- Prevents false positives from isolated words\n- Added debug logging for skipped segments\n\nAnalysis Service:\n- Remove ''Honest'' from competitors list\n- Prevents false matches with common word ''honest'' in transcripts\n\nThese changes improve the accuracy of sentiment analysis by focusing on segments with sufficient context.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebb4d7b4ec7ad9719ac83c0b4e193e19fe0e6337","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/ebb4d7b4ec7ad9719ac83c0b4e193e19fe0e6337"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/f03bb3e30c523dec7fb62a29c9f898e6897f1625","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http