-13T17:45:57Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Fix sentiment analysis API format to match n8n workflow\n\n- Changed from sending ''context'' and ''transcript'' as two files\n- Now sends ''context'' as form data (plain text) and ''file'' as binary upload\n- Matches n8n HTTP request format: context=string, file=JSON binary\n- context parameter now contains just competitor name (e.g., ''EE'', ''Vodafone'')\n- file parameter contains the reformatted transcript JSON with metadata\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfb4713a82192f55ad644c7cc966c5764270bc4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/cfb4713a82192f55ad644c7cc966c5764270bc4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/8ec03492de48f1ed0b87408ac6feee4e1c0b4fd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_vi