"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/commits/ac9f0ed17d3433de9266a3a2cdbd6eee667c1542/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-13T14:53:30Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-13T14:53:30Z","email":"jjwoods1@icloud.com","name":"Jaidon Woods"},"message":"Add comprehensive analytics dashboard\n\nBackend Changes:\n- Added /analytics/overview endpoint (total jobs, competitors, top mentions, sentiment distribution)\n- Added /analytics/competitor/{name} endpoint (detailed stats per competitor with percentages)\n- Added /analytics/competitors/list endpoint (all competitors alphabetically)\n- Added /analytics/sentiment-trends endpoint (trends over time)\n- All queries optimized with PostgreSQL aggregation functions\n\nFrontend Changes:\n- Created new /analytics page with full dashboard\n- Overview cards showing total calls and unique competitors\n- Top 10 competitors table with drill-down functionality\n- Overall sentiment distribution cards\n- All competitors grid (clickable chips)\n- Detailed competitor view modal with:\n  * Total mentions and unique calls\n  * Sentiment breakdown table with percentages\n  * Visual progress bars for sentiment distribution\n- Updated navigation to include Analytics link\n- Added analytics API helper functions (getAnalyticsOverview, getCompetitorAnalytics, getAllCompetitors)\n- Added getSentimentColor helper for consistent color coding\n\nFeatures:\n- Real-time analytics from database\n- Interactive competitor selection\n- Percentage calculations for sentiment breakdown\n- Clean, responsive UI with Pico.css\n- Color-coded sentiment indicators (green=positive, red=negative, blue=neutral)\n\nAnalytics Available:\n- X calls mentioned [competitor]\n- [Competitor] had X% negative/positive/neutral sentiment\n- Top mentioned competitors across all calls\n- Sentiment distribution across all analyses","tree":{"sha":"ad2311ed8d29c9331726cc5e7446140b2a4b4951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/trees/ad2311ed8d29c9331726cc5e7446140b2a4b4951"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jjwoods1/sentiment-analysis-microservice-architecture/git/commits/ac9f0ed17d3433de9266a3a2cdbd6eee667c1542","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135322706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jjwoods1","id":135322706,"login":"jjwoods1","node_id":"U_kgDOCBDcUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjwoods1/received_events","r