ate(): update comment, read-path enforcement stays in Jackson layer\n  - add getNonWritableFieldNames() + clearNonEditableFieldsForCreate() helpers\n- FieldScopeBeanSerializerModifier: only wrap org.simplepoint classes,\n  skip framework/library types to avoid unnecessary wrapper objects\n- DataScopeCondition: already has isAllData()/isSelf() from previous commit\n\nFrontend:\n- SForm: add OrgTreeMultiSelect custom RJSF widget (loads org tree, renders\n  as Ant TreeSelect multi-select, stores selected IDs as string array)\n- DataScope view: use formSchemaTransform to inject RJSF dependencies so\n  customDeptIds field appears reactively when type=CUSTOM; use beforeSubmit\n  to clear customDeptIds when type switches away from CUSTOM\n\nDocs:\n- data-permission-integration.md: add Spring proxy boundary warning for\n  @DataScopeFilter; document write-side field enforcement and its caveats\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"447628f014cca7df653d28e0f394d0c3954b06ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/447628f014cca7df653d28e0f394d0c3954b06ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/57270b9a5691779701360646c36e5894903ab653","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/57270b9a5691779701360646c36e5894903ab653","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDU3MjcwYjlhNTY5MTc3OTcwMTM2MDY0NmMzNmU1ODk0OTAzYWI2NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2","sha":"ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2"}],"sha":"57270b9a5691779701360646c36e5894903ab653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/57270b9a5691779701360646c36e5894903ab653"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:35:14Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:35:14Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"feat: activate @DataScopeFilter on BaseServiceImpl.limit() and update docs\n\n- Add @DataScopeFilter(ownerField=\"createdBy\", deptField=\"orgId\") to\n  BaseServiceImpl.limit() so row-level filtering is active for all services\n  by default; missing fields on an entity are silently ignored\n- Add DataScopeCondition.isAllData() / isSelf() convenience methods\n  referenced in docs but previously missing from the class\n- Rewrite data-permission-integration.md to document the automatic (zero-code)\n  approach, the Jackson-based field masking module, the correct scope\n  assignment API endpoints, and how to opt-out or override per service\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"08ed975edc56ee628ecfcacc00b065ea0ef1eff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/08ed975edc56ee628ecfcacc00b065ea0ef1eff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGFlN2VhYWU0M2YzZGI4ODdiZDYxZGQxYzhkNTU5MDJkNTQyZjE3YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d","sha":"e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d"}],"sha":"ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/ae7eaae43f3db887bd61dd1c8d55902d542f17b2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:30:53Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:30:53Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"完成数据权限/字段权限系统\n\n- 后端：新增 RoleScopeAssignmentVo，在 RolePermissionsRelevanceRepository 增加\n  findFirstByTenantIdAndRoleId / updateScopeForRole 方法，RoleService / RolesServiceImpl\n  实现 getScopeAssignment / updateScopeAssignment，RoleController 增加\n  GET/PUT /roles/scope-assignment 两个端点\n- 后端：BaseRepositoryImpl.readSpecification() 读取 DataScopeContext，当注解\n  @DataScopeFilter 激活时自动把 SELF/DEPT/DEPT_AND_BELOW/CUSTOM 行级过滤\n  谓词 AND 进查询\n- 后端：新增 FieldScopeBeanPropertyWriter / FieldScopeBeanSerializerModifier /\n  FieldScopeJacksonModule，在 Jackson 序列化阶段根据 AuthorizationContext\n  中的 fieldPermissions 自动 HIDDEN（跳过字段）或 MASKED（脱敏输出）\n- 前端：新增 data-scope.ts API，补充 field-scope.ts fetchItems，role.ts\n  增加 dataScopeId/fieldScopeId 字段及 fetchScopeAssignment/updateScopeAssignment\n- 前端：角色权限配置页新增数据权限和字段权限 Select，切换时自动调用\n  updateScopeAssignment，授权权限时携带当前选中的 scope IDs\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c4c094e3b401ce4ea7ae7df9a84bf549714c370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/8c4c094e3b401ce4ea7ae7df9a84bf549714c370"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGU4Njg0ZTk4MmIxYjEzZmFjZTFhOGI4NmNhZDM3OTE5NmM2Njg2MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec","sha":"e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec"}],"sha":"e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e8684e982b1b13face1a8b86cad379196c66860d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:03:14Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:03:14Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(i18n): align entity annotations with JSON namespace keys and add missing translations\n\nEntity annotation fixes:\n- DataScope: data-scope.* → data-scopes.* (match JSON file namespace)\n- FieldScope: field-scope.* → field-scopes.*\n- FieldScopeEntry: field-scope-entry.title/description.X → field-scopes.title/description.entry.X\n\nJSON additions:\n- field-scopes (zh-CN + en-US): add entry.fieldScopeId key\n- menus (zh-CN + en-US): add parent title/description\n- features en-US: add publicAccess title/description (zh-CN already had it)\n- users (zh-CN + en-US): add preferredUsername, website, zoneinfo translations\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d27c3d305d2b941089d9e7b60045a2c7d5625ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/9d27c3d305d2b941089d9e7b60045a2c7d5625ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGU0YWJkMGIzNDkzMmUxNDQxYjIxYWRkM2U3OTRhNWI4MTU3ODM5ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/6d967e19eb950dbf21ecf77b0599d776a31b6b3d","sha":"6d967e19eb950dbf21ecf77b0599d776a31b6b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/6d967e19eb950dbf21ecf77b0599d776a31b6b3d"}],"sha":"e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e4abd0b34932e1441b21add3e794a5b8157839ec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/6d967e19eb950dbf21ecf77b0599d776a31b6b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:52:05Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:52:05Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(i18n): make supplement init idempotent and add data-scopes/field-scopes\n\n- Add findExistingKeys() to I18nMessageRepository API and JPA impl\n  Returns composite locale:namespace:code keys for a set of namespaces,\n  enabling pre-insert deduplication without catching constraint violations\n- Add data-scopes and field-scopes to SUPPLEMENT_NAMESPACES so the\n  supplement module covers them even when data-permission module already ran\n- Update supplementMessagesRegister to query existing keys before inserting,\n  skipping any message already in DB to prevent unique constraint violations\n\nC