entialsNonExpired\n- Add i18n-messages-supplement-v1 DataInitRegister bean to auto-load\n  these namespaces on first startup after the patch\n- Enable i18n-messages-supplement-v1 in Consul config\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3dbaa941b7960049ffaa6c134e0421502adff4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/3dbaa941b7960049ffaa6c134e0421502adff4c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/2e27fd0aac30587405264c51e4fba07000f5726e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/2e27fd0aac30587405264c51e4fba07000f5726e","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDJlMjdmZDBhYWMzMDU4NzQwNTI2NGM1MWU0ZmJhMDcwMDBmNTcyNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e","sha":"a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e"}],"sha":"2e27fd0aac30587405264c51e4fba07000f5726e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/2e27fd0aac30587405264c51e4fba07000f5726e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:25:08Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:25:08Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"feat(i18n): add data-permission i18n auto-initialization module\n\nAdd i18n-messages-data-permission DataInitRegister bean that loads\ndata-scopes and field-scopes namespaces on first startup, bypassing\nthe already-executed i18n-messages module.\nEnable the new module in Consul config for local dev.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"02e01ec3b74a431ce46ca86ab9a94bd3b3451950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/02e01ec3b74a431ce46ca86ab9a94bd3b3451950"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGEwYzg2NzYzOWYwOWQ4ZjUwMmEwNTQzYWYxZTAyNmM2OWQ2ZGEzM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9","sha":"1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9"}],"sha":"a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/a0c867639f09d8f502a0543af1e026c69d6da33e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:05:34Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:05:34Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"feat(rbac): add DataScope/FieldScope menu entries and config.entries button\n\n- Add ''数据权限策略'' and ''字段权限策略'' menu entries to simple-menu.json\n  under ''系统配置'' section, with full CRUD permission definitions\n- Add config.entries ButtonDeclaration to FieldScope entity\n- Add field-scopes.button.config.entries i18n keys (en-US + zh-CN)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"406a1ed307724001110d2aeb208b4507c8d22d2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/406a1ed307724001110d2aeb208b4507c8d22d2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDFhNTE1NDFlY2I5ZTU2YzQyOGVmNzA2ODMzMmM5NTg5MDE0OGJiYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87","sha":"58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87"}],"sha":"1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/1a51541ecb9e56c428ef7068332c95890148bbb9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T05:59:57Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T05:59:57Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"feat(rbac): complete data permission system — DEPT tree, i18n, and integration doc\n\n- Add orgId field to User entity for DEPT/DEPT_AND_BELOW scope support\n- Extend AuthorizationContextServiceImpl with OrganizationRepository provider;\n  resolve DEPT deptIds as {user.orgId}; resolve DEPT_AND_BELOW via BFS traversal\n  of org tree using OrganizationRepository#findIdsByParentIds; fall back to SELF\n  when user has no orgId assigned\n- Update AuthorizationContextServiceImplTest for 8-parameter constructor\n- Add i18n keys for DataScope and FieldScope (en-US and zh-CN)\n- Add doc/api/data-permission-integration.md integration guide\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5de00ac1dd4cede354cb3b9916cbeee385c21444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/5de00ac1dd4cede354cb3b9916cbeee385c21444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDU4ZDhjODg5ZjU0MzEzMmNhNTlhMjM3MTEzZDczNzY2YmU3YjViODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20","sha":"456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20"}],"sha":"58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/58d8c889f543132ca59a237113d73766be7b5b87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T05:13:47Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T05:13:47Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"feat(rbac): implement data permission system (row-level + field-level)\n\n- Add DataScopeType enum (ALL/DEPT_AND_BELOW/DEPT/CUSTOM/SELF) with permissive ordering\n- Add FieldAccessType enum (EDITABLE/VISIBLE/MASKED/HIDDEN) with permissive ordering\n- Add DataScope entity (table simpoint_ac_data_scope) with @ElementCollection customDeptIds\n- Add FieldScope + FieldScopeEntry entities (tables simpoint_ac_field_scope, simpoint_ac_field_scope_entry)\n- Extend AuthorizationContext with dataScopeType, deptIds, fieldPermissions (setOnce, Redis-safe)\n- Add @DataScopeFilter annotation + DataScopeCondition + DataScopeContext (ThreadLocal)\n- Add DataScopeAspect: intercepts @DataScopeFilter methods, populates DataScopeContext\n- Add DataScopeRepository, FieldScopeRepository interfaces and JPA implementations\n- Add DataScopeService, FieldScopeService with cache invalidation on every mutation\n- Extend RolePermissionsRelevanceRepository with findByRoleIdIn()\n- Rewrite AuthorizationContextServiceImpl to resolve data/field scope and populate context\n- Update RolePermissionsRelevanceDto + RolesServiceImpl.authorize() for dataScopeId/fieldScopeId\n- Add DataScopeController (CRUD under /data-scopes)\n- Add FieldScopeController (CRUD + entries replace under /field-scopes)\n- Update AuthorizationContextServiceImplTest for new constructor parameters\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddabab665f02a4e84b410df30db087329f53ff22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/ddabab665f02a4e84b410df30db087329f53ff22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDQ1NmFiOTNlNjJjYjk0ODljZmU3NzhhZjhlNTk4ODQwNTE3OWRiMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857","sha":"5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857"}],"sha":"456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/456ab93e62cb9489cfe778af8e5988405179db20"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:57:45Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:57:45Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(dna): update data source handling in UI, adjust related configurations and translations","tree":{"sha":"0d584b55c3b10d716b7885017d5ba1a6da53cb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/0d584b55c3b10d716b7885017d5ba1a6da53cb28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDUxNjRiZWM1YmU0MDc1ODBhYWYxMzJkZTBmNmJmM2Q2YzFjNDE4NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d","sha":"683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d"}],"sha":"5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/5164bec5be407580aaf132de0f6bf3d6c1c41857"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:11:15Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:11:15Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(auth): register postLogoutRedirectUri so OIDC logout no longer returns 400\n\n- Add postLogoutRedirectUris field to Oauth2ClientInitializeProperties.Registration\n  so the auth server can be seeded with allowed post-logout redirect URIs from config.\n- Pass those URIs through ClientRegistrationInitialize.buildRegisteredClient() via\n  RegisteredClient.Builder.postLogoutRedirectUri().\n- Change ClientRegistrationInitialize.run() to always upsert (not only on first run),\n  so config changes take effect on restart without needing a DB wipe.\n- Make RegisteredClientRepositoryImpl.save() upsert-aware: if a client with the same\n  clientId already exists it reuses its JPA id, causing JPA to UPDATE rather than\n  INSERT. This keeps the UUID stable so existing authorization records stay valid.\n- Add post-logout-redirect-uris[0] to local-dev and swarm Consul configs.\n- Add diagnostic error logging in OidcAuthorizationServiceImpl.parseMap().\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a4d11b6d71c639d6e597ff159b229898940d69b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/1a4d11b6d71c639d6e597ff159b229898940d69b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDY4MzU3MzU0MGM4YjVhMjMzMjIxMDkwOTRjMjUzMDkyYmMxNDFlOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8","sha":"6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8"}],"sha":"683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/683573540c8b5a23322109094c253092bc141e9d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T17:21:09Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T17:21:09Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(auth): register JavaTimeModule in OidcAuthorizationServiceImpl to fix OIDC logout 400\n\nThe custom ObjectMapper in OidcAuthorizationServiceImpl lacked JavaTimeModule,\ncausing Instant fields in the User JPA entity (createdAt, updatedAt, etc.) to\nbe serialized as plain JSON objects {\"epochSecond\":...,\"nano\":...}. On the\nnext deserialization (triggered by /connect/logout), Jackson could not reconstruct\nInstant from those objects → IllegalArgumentException → caught by\nOidcLogoutEndpointFilter → 400 Bad Request.\n\nFixes:\n- Register JavaTimeModule (with WRITE_DATES_AS_TIMESTAMPS=false so Instant\n  serializes as ISO-8601 strings) in OidcAuthorizationServiceImpl.\n- Add @JsonIgnore to User.authorities (transient, never persisted, and\n  Collections.emptyList() is not safely round-trippable with default typing).\n\nNote: existing authorization records in the DB were serialized with the broken\nformat and will remain unreadable. Users should re-login once after deployment\nto create new, correctly-serialized authorization records.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"05b63d826298ede41bf9eb82a8e2be5e603ef9dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/05b63d826298ede41bf9eb82a8e2be5e603ef9dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDZiZTE3NDY4YTlkOTdkZTJkY2EzMTQ4NWRmYzlhMTA2MzU4ZDMzYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50","sha":"2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50"}],"sha":"6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/6be17468a9d97de2dca31485dfc9a106358d33c8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T16:43:25Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T16:43:25Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"chore: update frontend submodule pointer after rebase onto master\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"afbf7abd8c404a571f19c8026c7f20502fdfc5fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/afbf7abd8c404a571f19c8026c7f20502fdfc5fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDJjMWNiYmI0NzUyZDg4OTkzYThkYTQ5YjE5Zjc1OTUwNjAxNTllNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8","sha":"b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8"}],"sha":"2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/2c1cbbb4752d88993a8da49b19f7595060159e50"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T16:41:31Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T16:41:31Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(auth): repair logout, registration, and login error display\n\n- AuthorizationServerConfiguration: explicitly permitAll \"/login\" so\n  /login?error, /login?logout, /login?registered are reachable.\n  Spring Security 7''s formLogin().permitAll() uses ExactUrlRequestMatcher\n  (path+query) and our custom failureHandler nulls out failureUrl, so the\n  query-suffixed login URLs were redirected to /login (query stripped),\n  hiding all alert messages.\n- RegisterController: stop pre-setting User.id (let @UuidStringGenerator\n  handle it) and stop double-encoding the password (UsersServiceImpl.create\n  already encodes). Fixes ObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException on\n  self-registration and login failure for newly registered accounts.\n- Submodule: bump open-simplepoint-dashboard-react with the matching\n  redirectToLogout() change so the frontend submits a real form POST to\n  /logout (cookies attached) instead of an AJAX call that the\n  LogoutFilter ignores.\n\nOther staged changes are accumulated unrelated work (router/menu, JPA\nrouting data source) that the user requested to include.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"279fe00b119af8298b4ebf3f6f273baa97e8cabd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/279fe00b119af8298b4ebf3f6f273baa97e8cabd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGIwNWY1ZDA0Yzg1MzE3MGE3NmIwMmRiMWFmZGI1NjNmNjUwZTNjZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5","sha":"4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5"}],"sha":"b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/b05f5d04c853170a76b02db1afdb563f650e3ce8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:32:37Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:32:37Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(oidc): guard ClientRegistrationInitialize with ConditionalOnProperty\n\n- Add @ConditionalOnProperty(name = spring.security.oauth2.init-client.enabled,\n  matchIfMissing = true) to ClientRegistrationInitialize so it can be disabled\n  per-service without removing the bean declaration\n- Disable init-client in authorization service\n  (spring.security.oauth2.init-client.enabled=false) to avoid re-registering\n  clients on every startup in production-like environments\n- Reformat class to 4-space indentation (consistent with project style)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc1a92849f90d2b043394f712b05ba2f37d4bfbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/bc1a92849f90d2b043394f712b05ba2f37d4bfbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDRlNWJkNGNjOTkxOTUzZmQ0YjA3OGE5NTlmYjdjNDYxZDZmZTRhZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344","sha":"e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344"}],"sha":"4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/4e5bd4cc991953fd4b078a959fb7c461d6fe4af5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:32:27Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T13:32:27Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(consul): refactor dev consul config; move OAuth2 client config to global\n\n- Move OAuth2 client registration config into application/application.properties\n  so all services share it via the standard Consul Config hierarchy\n- Add server.oauth2.issuer-uri as a shared shorthand for the issuer URI\n- Parameterize server.host with ${SERVER_HOST:localhost} for env-based override\n- Add health-check-url to host/application.properties\n- Remove profile-suffixed dirs (auditing-dev, common-dev, dna-dev, host-dev);\n  merged into profile-less directories loaded via spring.profiles.active\n- Remove oauth2/client.properties and oauth2/resource.properties;\n  spring.config.import=consul:<path> cannot load arbitrary KV paths\n- Move service-common application-dev.properties into common/application.properties\n  in Consul (loaded via profile-less dir + spring.profiles.active=dev)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e4db29b2ea4575612e7727251cdec9eaa2ecfc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/4e4db29b2ea4575612e7727251cdec9eaa2ecfc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGUzOGU2Zjk4MWYyMmQ3YzhlODZkZTJmOWU4YmJjZGE3YTY2ZDYzNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/589045347429c86948524e2549a1cd36d9d01609","sha":"589045347429c86948524e2549a1cd36d9d01609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/589045347429c86948524e2549a1cd36d9d01609"}],"sha":"e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/e38e6f981f22d7c8e86de2f9e8bbcda7a66d6344"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/589045347429c86948524e2549a1cd36d9d01609/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T12:24:10Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T12:24:10Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"fix(consul): host-dev loads oauth2/client.properties via spring.config.import\n\nReplace inline-duplicated OAuth2 client settings in host-dev with\nspring.config.import=consul:;consul:simplepoint/config/oauth2/client.properties,\nmatching the pattern already used by common-dev. This ensures host\nand common always share the same OAuth2 client settings from a\nsingle source of truth.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8068511ea1f7a32c662caec1fbe516b1adc3fd93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/8068511ea1f7a32c662caec1fbe516b1adc3fd93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/589045347429c86948524e2549a1cd36d9d01609","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/589045347429c86948524e2549a1cd36d9d01609","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDU4OTA0NTM0NzQyOWM4Njk0ODUyNGUyNTQ5YTFjZDM2ZDlkMDE2MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/46a2a01efdf09368aaede2f3aa68668fdb986dd0","sha":"46a2a01efdf09368aaede2f3aa68668fdb986dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/46a2a01efdf0936