da15c800d04f3223"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/d1917809d9b5d1f226094438e941d656c4a22374/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:06:58Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:06:58Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"feat(dna): wire i18n into Dashboard, SqlConsole, and DataLineage views\n\n- Add dna-dashboard namespace with ~25 keys (zh-CN, en-US, ja-JP)\n- Expand dna-federation-sql-console namespace: loadCatalogs/loadChildren\n  error messages, refreshTree success, submit warnings/progress/success/\n  error, tab labels, field/state labels, card titles, button labels,\n  placeholders, alerts, and empty-state descriptions\n- Expand dna-data-lineage namespace with all UI keys (nodeType, edgeType,\n  modal, button, label, placeholder, alert)\n- Dashboard/index.tsx: replace all hardcoded strings with t(); pass t as\n  prop to MiniBarChart; add t to auditColumns useMemo deps\n- SqlConsole/index.tsx: move resolveNodeTypeLabel inside App as useCallback;\n  pass resolveNodeTypeLabel to buildDataSourceTreeNodes and\n  normalizeMetadataTreeNodes; replace all hardcoded strings with t();\n  add t/resolveNodeTypeLabel to useCallback dependency arrays\n- DataLineage/index.tsx: already uses t() — locale keys now present\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f59fef94d730c9368c596165110ece3cac0f36ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/f59fef94d730c9368c596165110ece3cac0f36ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/d1917809d9b5d1f226094438e941d656c4a22374","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/com