) helper; session/auth management stays in main class\n- Add FederationJdbcMetadataQueryServiceImplTest with 28 unit tests covering all 10\n  metadata methods and the 3 package-private static helpers\n- Update FederationJdbcDriverServiceImplTest to construct\n  FederationJdbcMetadataQueryServiceImpl(jdbcMetadataSupport) so mock verifications hold\n\nPart 2 – simplepoint-data-cp additional unit tests\n- Add DataSourceContextHolderPropertiesTest with 11 tests covering:\n  putProperties/getProperties, overwrite, getAllProperties, remove (idempotent,\n  non-interference), refresh (replace old props), and ThreadLocal isolation\n  across concurrent threads\n\nPart 3 – simplepoint-security-oauth2-server unit tests\n- Add TotpServiceTest (14 tests): generateSecret, buildOtpAuthUrl, verifyCode edge cases\n- Add TwoFactorSetupServiceImplTest (13 tests): enable, confirm, currentPending, disable\n- Add TwoFactorAuthenticationProviderTest (10 tests): supports, authenticate branches\n  (non-TwoFactor token, 2FA disabled, null secret, non-User principal, valid/invalid code)\n- Add TwoFactorAuthenticationTokenTest (9 tests): both constructors, credentials,\n  principal, authorities, null-safe\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa2373a8b7fe30b78e0018c5fb62f77ad4ec6b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/aa2373a8b7fe30b78e0018c5fb62f77ad4ec6b7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/7a7a1629cc2801e60185d530a30ee3116a0f5186","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/7a7a1629cc2801e60185d530a30ee3116a0f5186","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKDdhN2ExNjI5Y2MyODAxZTYwMTg1ZDUzMGEzMGVlMzExNmEwZjUxODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30","sha":"d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30"}],"sha":"7a7a1629cc2801e60185d530a30ee3116a0f5186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/7a7a1629cc2801e60185d530a30ee3116a0f5186"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T09:26:54Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T09:26:54Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"refactor(dna): split FederationSqlConsoleServiceImpl god class\n\nExtract four focused helpers from the 1246-line god class:\n\n- FederationSqlAnalysisUtils: static SQL analysis utilities\n  (collectTableReferences, extractUsedDataSources,\n   resolveResponseDataSources, normalizeQualifiedIdentifiers,\n   buildPushdownSummary) plus inner TableReferenceSummary /\n   TableReferenceCollector.\n\n- FederationDmlStatementProcessor: DML datasource resolution and\n  SQL rewrite (resolve, rewrite, DmlTarget, DmlTableRewriter).\n\n- FederationDdlStatementProcessor: DDL datasource resolution and\n  SQL rewrite (resolve, rewrite, stripQuotes, DdlTarget,\n  DDL_PREFIX_PATTERN, DDL_TABLE_NAME_PATTERN).\n\n- FederationSqlAuditor: audit record persistence\n  (persist, recordFailure, toElapsedMs, resolveMessage).\n\nFederationSqlConsoleServiceImpl is now an orchestration layer that\nwires the helpers via constructor. Spring constructor signature is\nunchanged so no Spring wiring changes are required.\n\nAdd unit tests:\n- FederationDmlStatementProcessorTest (11 tests)\n- FederationDdlStatementProcessorTest (14 tests)\n- FederationSqlAuditorTest (10 tests)\n- FederationSqlConsoleServiceImplTest: +8 parameter-validation tests\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c32851a4d165ca6f96b2da55a63559a04496c39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/trees/0c32851a4d165ca6f96b2da55a63559a04496c39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/git/commits/d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30","node_id":"C_kwDOQB-AgtoAKGQ1ODQxNTVmNjlhZjk3ZTBkY2M5MzRjM2QzYzZhYmM1OGY2YTdhMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commit/039e5dd178c78ea7b49e4c0cfca423829f4ca5b8","sha":"039e5dd178c78ea7b49e4c0cfca423829f4ca5b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/039e5dd178c78ea7b49e4c0cfca423829f4ca5b8"}],"sha":"d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/d584155f69af97e0dcc934c3d3c6abc58f6a7a30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/simplepoint1024/open-simplepoint-dashboard/commits/039e5dd178c78ea7b49e4c0cfca423829f4ca5b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T11:40:20Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T11:40:20Z","email":"simplepointd@gmail.com","name":"刘金旭"},"message":"ci: add frontend build validation and release workflow\n\n- Add pnpm build step to CI frontend job\n- Add release.yml: triggered by v* tags, runs full build+test,\n  then creates a GitHub Release with auto-generated changelog\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6e340f13996143f59cb9996f5771a7a45c607fb","url":"https://api.github.com/